  - R package
  - hydrology
  - climatology
abstract: >-
  An R package for Generalized L-moments Estimation of the Generalized
  Extreme Value (GEV) Distribution. Implements stationary GEV, non-stationary
  GEV11 models, and model averaging (MAGEV) for robust high quantile estimation.
  Includes various penalty functions for shape parameter regularization.
